  "worked_solution": "To subtract $4$ from $-1$, we start at $-1$ on the number line and move $4$ places to the left. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14147971/assets/2a3053731477b69e722e0a17fab04977b3d954c8bbf795933c5bf98fb27fd137.png)\n\nThis gives $-1-4=-5.$",
